				<h3>Required vs optional — at a glance</h3>
				<ul>
					<li>
						<strong>Required:</strong> the User ID and password for sign-in (Step 4); the
						<code>List_of_Refrences.txt</code> and <code>User_Agents.txt</code> files (they
						come with the package — just keep them selected); and, if proxies are enabled, a
						List of Proxies file.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Optional:</strong> proxies in general, proxy login/password, and the
						premium fingerprint service.
